 "schema": "pcc.claim/v1",
 "scope": "Original arbitrary-leaf two-source module and scalar finite-chart lower-profile residual; full weighted/asymptotic and growing-residual-module diagnostics hand only.",
 "statement": "Selector module/subresultant source audit:27 generic laws and10 symbolic applications compile; final all-tracked canonical gate002 exits0:526/0/0. Arbitrary leaf multipliers of original F1W\u00b2/F2 retain a five-coefficient curve code through least-degree extraction. Exact finite-chart factor removal yields residual profile1,2, preserves all original exceptional branches, and has full projective chart/model anchors and a four-window finite model bound. Conditional finite universal-cover arithmetic gives p<729Q\u00b2. Full modular-row/weighted-norm/asymptotic/pool instantiation and growing saturated-residual rank diagnostic remain HAND; selector unimplemented, useful original yield absent. Earlier gate001 aborted after an incorrectly reported application pass; raw evidence and append-only correction preserved, final actual005 pass. No scientific/numerical/native qualification/paid execution, independent signed verdict or complete subexponential ECDLP algorithm."
}
